<title>USA: TABLE- J.C. PENNEY JULY SAME-STORE UP 2 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE- J.C. PENNEY JULY SAME-STORE UP 2 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>PLANO, Texas 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $2,049     $1,478     +38.6	 +2.0</p>
<p>Year-to-date   $12,901     $8,959     +44.0	 +3.3</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is   four weeks ended	August 2.</p>
<p>Full company name is J.C. Penney Co Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: The same-store sales figures are JC Penney department stores only.  </p>
<p>JC Penney department stores' sales rose 3.0 percent to $1,093 million from $1,061 million in the four-week period. Year-to-date sales rose 4.5 percent to $6,681 from $6,393.</p>
<p>The other sales figures include Eckerd drug stores and the company's catalog operations.</p>
<p>Eckerd's same-store sales rose 7.7 percent in the four-week period and 7.7 percent year-to-date.</p>
</text>
